    https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core — Mozilla Public License 2.0.

Wintun
    The TUN driver Xray uses on Windows (wintun.dll), shipped in the Windows
    installer. https://www.wintun.net — © WireGuard LLC, distributed under
    the license that accompanies its prebuilt binaries.

Tauri
    The application shell. https://tauri.app — MIT or Apache-2.0.

Inter and Orbitron
    The interface fonts, through @fontsource. SIL Open Font License 1.1.

flag-icons
    The country flags. https://github.com/lipis/flag-icons — MIT.

The Rust and npm dependencies are listed in Cargo.lock and
app/package-lock.json; `cargo deny check licenses` verifies that every Rust
dependency's license allows Wanderer's.
